# Normalise line endings in the index so a file rewritten on Windows does not
# surface as a diff of every line. package-lock.json is regenerated by npm on
# whatever platform runs the install, and was producing ~21k lines of pure CRLF
# churn around ~1.5k lines of real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
